.TH DEEPSEEK-HARNESS 1 "2026" "deepseek-harness" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
deepseek-harness \- CLI harness for DeepSeek models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deepseek-harness
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B deepseek-harness
is a command line harness that wraps DeepSeek models with a local,
reproducible workflow.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/deepseek-harness/
User configuration directory (created with mode 0700 on first use).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
API key used to authenticate against the DeepSeek API. Prefer reading it
from your shell's secret manager; never commit it to version control.
.TP
.B DH_NODE_BIN
Path to the Node.js binary when using the system-node variant.
.SH SEE ALSO
The project homepage for full documentation.
